  "limitations": [
   "Cutoffs are every 1 month(s); neighbouring cutoffs and the 90-day horizon share most of their history and holdout months, so the cases are not independent and the number of cases overstates how much evidence there is.",
   "The risk signal is judged against a rise in the monthly average purchase price of at least 5%. That is a definition chosen before the run, not the only reasonable one.",
